          "explanation": "Correct! $\\det(A) = ad - bc = (3)(2) - (1)(5) = 1 \\neq 0$, so $A$ is invertible.",
          "insight": "Nonzero determinant guarantees the inverse exists."
        },
        "incorrect": {
