          "id": "a",
          "text": "$A^{-1} = \\frac{1}{1}\\begin{bmatrix} 2 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 3 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 2 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 3 \\end{bmatrix}$"
